Scope and third-party material

The MIT terms cover original project contributions and the ENet and CGNet
portions attributed above. The following material is excluded from that grant:

- src/wildfire_kd/models/FDDWNet.py: upstream permissions remain unresolved.
- eval_image and init_seeds in src/wildfire_kd/utils.py: adapted from Sen2Fire
  by Yonghao Xu, Amanda Berg, and Leif Haglund; upstream terms are unconfirmed.
  Source: https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.10881058
- scripts/prepare_data.py and data/split/*.csv: ActiveFire material under
  CC-BY-4.0 by Gabriel Henrique de Almeida Pereira, André Minoro Fusioka,
  Bogdan Tomoyuki Nassu, and Rodrigo Minetto.
  Source: https://github.com/pereira-gha/activefire
  License: https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/
  The extraction script modifies paths, directory handling, and ZIP deletion.

External datasets, model weights, dependencies, and the published paper retain
their own terms. See README.md for upstream sources and licensing details.
